    {
      "_id": "d6GaNaSHJTR2kFXI",
      "name": "Cache of Weapons",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The gan'arg uses one of the following options (roll a d6 or choose one); the gan'arg can use each one no more than once per day:\n\n- 1. High Explosive Sheep. \n- 2. Mana Bomb. \n- 3. Goblin Dragon Gun. \n- 4. Rocket Launcher. \n- 5. Recombobulate. \n- 6. Magnetic Bomb. The gan'arg throws a magnetic bomb within 30 feet of itself, forcing all creatures either wearing metal armor or wielding metal weapons within 15 feet of it to make a DC 13 Strength saving throw. On a failed save, the creature is pulled 10 feet toward the bomb if its wearing metal armor, or loses its weapon as its pulled toward the bomb if wielding a metallic weapon.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
